  "f2p_absence": {
    "audited_paths": [],
    "reason": "The defect is that a toggle button keeps painting its unpressed icon after activation. The activation handler still runs and reports success, so the discrepancy is visible only in the rendered button."
  },
  "fix_commit": "2a285417e79db4bac7b4a7bf9ca9e88b75a61ecc",
  "issue": {
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "assignee": null,
    "assignees": [],
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body_normalized": "## Description\n\nWhen screen space is tight the toolbar items get collapse in a second, hidden row under \"More commands\" button (`...`). This button does not indicate whether it is pressed or not - it always has `aria-pressed=\"false\"`\n\n## Reproduce\n\n1. Open notebook\n2. resize until toolbar overflow\n3. Press `...`\n4. See the `...` button does not change\n\nNot pressed:\n\n![Screenshot from 2023-04-30 12-13-40](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5832902/235349947-55d9a777-b0d4-417c-b94b-fa9a8a4988ae.png)\n\nPressed:\n\n![Screenshot from 2023-04-30 12-13-37](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5832902/235349946-8bdd0b18-9d66-4d05-93e4-c9bc95310ab4.png)\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nwe reflect the state by updating\n- `aria-pressed=\"true\"`\n- some visual style representing \"pressed\" (e.g. background)\n\n## Context\n\n- JupyterLab version: 4.0.0rc0 and earlier",
    "body_raw": "## Description\r\n\r\nWhen screen space is tight the toolbar items get collapse in a second, hidden row under \"More commands\" button (`...`). This button does not indicate whether it is pressed or not - it always has `aria-pressed=\"false\"`\r\n\r\n## Reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Open notebook\r\n2. resize until toolbar overflow\r\n3. Press `...`\r\n4. See the `...` button does not change\r\n\r\nNot pressed:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2023-04-30 12-13-40](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5832902/235349947-55d9a777-b0d4-417c-b94b-fa9a8a4988ae.png)\r\n\r\nPressed:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2023-04-30 12-13-37](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5832902/235349946-8bdd0b18-9d66-4d05-93e4-c9bc95310ab4.png)\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\n\r\nwe reflect the state by updating\r\n- `aria-pressed=\"true\"`\r\n- some visual style representing \"pressed\" (e.g. background)\r\n\r\n## Context\r\n\r\n- JupyterLab version: 4.0.0rc0 and earlier\r\n",
